# Metadata cutover pilot (P5-A)

Move from **CI shadow parity** (P3-D Stage 1) to **staging pilot** (Stage 2→3) without big-bang prod cutover or Denali operator regression.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p5/p5-a-cutover-pilot.md`](../../TEMP/p5/p5-a-cutover-pilot.md) v2.0

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc complete · implementation starts P5-A-N-001

---

## Executive summary

| Layer | P5-A delivers |
|-------|----------------|
| **Gate hygiene** | `p4:gate` / `p5:gate` use `guard:p3-denali-covenant` (scoped overlay) |
| **Cutover visibility** | Computed `metadataCutoverStage` on platform tenant detail — **no new DB column** |
| **Super Admin** | Club workspace tab: stage badge + definition version |
| **Observability** | Validation error counter when metadata path active |
| **Pilot ops** | Staging bind script + rollback runbook + allowlist expand procedure |
| **Phase gate** | `pnpm run p5:gate` |

---

## Goals

| Goal | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Staging pilot | 1+ smoke tenants on metadata path with allowlist |
| Rollback | Clear binding / shrink allowlist / flag off — no canonical rewrite |
| Visibility | Platform ops see cutover stage per club |
| Denali safety | Covenant + preservation checklist on every PR |
| No invented infra | Reuse existing audit actions and binding columns |

## Non-goals (P5-A v1)

- Global prod `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=true` for all tenants
- New Prisma `cutover_stage` column
- New platform audit action strings (use `TENANT_DEFINITION_ASSIGNED` / `CLEARED`)
- Operator wizard UI changes (Super Admin control plane only)
- HTTP edge strangler (in-process facade only)

---

## metadataCutoverStage (computed — frozen)

Implement in `apps/api/src/workspace-metadata/derive-metadata-cutover-stage.ts`:

| Stage | Condition |
|-------|-----------|
| `off` | `WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED` false **OR** `workspaceDefinitionId` null |
| `pilot` | Flag true + binding set + `WORKSPACE_METADATA_TENANT_ALLOWLIST` non-empty and tenant ∈ list |
| `live` | Flag true + binding set + allowlist unset/empty |
| `shadow` | **Doc label only** — CI parity specs; not stored on tenant |

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  REQ[GET platform tenant detail] --> FLAG{WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED?}
  FLAG -->|false| OFF[stage: off]
  FLAG -->|true| BIND{workspaceDefinitionId?}
  BIND -->|no| OFF
  BIND -->|yes| ALLOW{allowlist configured?}
  ALLOW -->|yes + tenant in list| PILOT[stage: pilot]
  ALLOW -->|yes + tenant excluded| OFF
  ALLOW -->|no| LIVE[stage: live]
```

Wire into `PlatformTenantWorkspaceDefinitionDto` via `toPlatformTenantDetailDto`.

---

## Staging pilot env (frozen)

```bash
# API pods (staging only)
WORKSPACE_METADATA_ENABLED=true
WORKSPACE_METADATA_TENANT_ALLOWLIST=<smoke-tenant-uuid>

# Bind definition via Super Admin or:
# apps/api/scripts/smoke-metadata-pilot-bind.mjs (P5-A-N-007)
```

**Rollback drill (P5-A-N-008):** clear `workspaceDefinitionId` on tenant → next request uses package path (`resolveWorkspacePluginForType`).

