## Observability

| Metric | Labels | When increment |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| `workspace_metadata_validation_errors_total` | `tenantId`, `workspaceType` | Canonical validation fails on metadata plugin path |

Baseline before expanding allowlist beyond smoke tenant.

