## Industry alignment

| Pattern | P5-A mapping |
|---------|--------------|
| Strangler Fig | `resolveWorkspacePluginForTenant` facade |
| Feature-flag rollout | Global flag + per-tenant allowlist |
| Parallel run | P3-D CI parity unchanged; prod pilot additive |
| Branch by abstraction | `WorkspacePlugin` interface unchanged |

See also: [`platform-workspace-cutover.mdoc`](../phase-16/platform-workspace-cutover.mdoc) Stage 2→3.

