## Preservation (mandatory)

Every P5-A PR must not regress Denali operator product. Gate:

```bash
pnpm run guard:p3-denali-covenant
pnpm run guard:import-boundary
```

Checklist: [`TEMP/p5/PRESERVATION-CHECKLIST.md`](../../TEMP/p5/PRESERVATION-CHECKLIST.md) PC-01..10.

